window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>In the shadows, he waits.</b></p> <p>Seraphine Winters had a normal life, one she misses when she's kidnapped and taken to an island in the middle of nowhere.</p> <p>Forced to attend Quarrierton Academy, a castle full of immortal beings, the only way she can leave is if she passes all her classes. But as a human, she's hated just for breathing, with no way to fit in around magic and powers she never knew existed.</p> <p>And who doesn't hate mortals more than Dane Dalton? The Shadow Prince loathes everything about her, yet there are more secrets and lies than truths between the pair, and it's a race against time when the curse is revealed.</p>"; 
